# keepsake pins v1
# Settings Keepsake keeps at your own value. Tab separated: the cfg file in
# BepInEx/config, the section, the setting, your value, then the profile's value.
# The profile's value may be left off; it is filled in on the next launch.
isimp.Example.cfg	General	Enabled	false	true
isimp.Example.cfg	Keys	Open	K	H
isimp.Example.cfg	Keys	Shortcut	H + LeftAlt	None
isimp.Example.cfg	Section: with colon	Toggle	F7
sub/Other.cfg	General	Speed	1.5	1
